  "markdown": "The Wallcovering Guide · Choose and source\n\n# Cole & Son\n\nCole & Son develops wallpaper and fabric collections through archive references and its artistic team. Buyers can use its product shop, contact client services or consult its official partner finder. Confirm country selection and sample terms separately.\n\n## Source evidence\n\nRead the maker’s information for the selected product and destination. A brand profile does not certify a seller or prove that an order will be accepted.\n\n- [Official source](https://cole-and-son.com/pages/our-heritage) — checked 2026-10-17\n- [Official source](https://cole-and-son.com/pages/frequently-asked-questions) — checked 2026-10-17\n- [Official source](https://cole-and-son.com/pages/contact-us) — checked 2026-10-17\n- [Official source](https://cole-and-son.com/en-ww/collections/wallpapers/products/diamond-maze-roll) — checked 2026-10-17\n\n[Visit maker website](https://cole-and-son.com/)\n\n## Official sourcing routes\n\nCheck the route’s scope before ordering. Showrooms, samples and finder links do not establish a roll checkout or delivery promise.\n\n### Shop or product ordering\n\nUse the official Diamond Maze product page to select a roll or sample. Check the selected country and delivery terms before ordering.\n\n**Region**\n: UK; international subject to delivery-country acceptance\n\n**UK access**\n: UK shipping is explicitly described.\n\n**Overseas access**\n: International wallpaper shipping is explicit but conditional on destination; unavailable countries directed to partner finder.\n\nMaker-published information; confirm current eligibility and destination before ordering.\n\nTerms and checks before ordering\n\nSamples are purchased; overseas sample duties may apply. Wallpaper-roll international duty treatment differs from samples. Account requirement and trade approval criteria not established; ask the maker.\n\nOfficial page checked 2026-10-17. Website evidence, not a test order.\n\n[Open official source](https://cole-and-son.com/en-ww/collections/wallpapers/products/diamond-maze-roll)\n\n### Showroom or brand contact\n\nVisit or contact flagship/showroom; contact client service for trade enquiries.\n\n**Region**\n: London, UK\n\n**UK access**\n: London physical contact and showroom routes evidenced.\n\n**Overseas access**\n: Remote contact possible; destination supply requires confirmation.\n\nMaker-published information; confirm current eligibility and destination before ordering.\n\nTerms and checks before ordering\n\nTrade enquiry channel is evidenced; account eligibility and showroom sample terms not established; ask the maker.\n\nOfficial page checked 2026-10-17. Website evidence, not a test order.\n\n[Open official source](https://cole-and-son.com/pages/contact-us)\n\n### Find a stockist or representative\n\nOpen Cole & Son’s official finder page. Check the country selection. Individual sellers and UK availability have not been verified.\n\n**Region**\n: UK and international search; individual listings unverified\n\n**UK access**\n: Intended local retailer search route; no individual UK listing verified.\n\n**Overseas access**\n: FAQ explicitly includes international distributor lookup; individual access remains unverified.\n\nOfficial link only; individual results and purchasing terms are not verified.\n\nTerms and checks before ordering\n\nOfficial finder link only; no seller, purchase eligibility, sample or delivery terms are endorsed.\n\nOfficial page checked 2026-10-18. Website evidence, not a test order.\n\n[Open official source](https://cole-and-son.com/pages/where-to-buy)\n\n[All makers](https://www.mrwallcover.com/makers/)\n\n## From sample to specification\n\nRecord the exact design and product code, check current instructions and establish the wall preparation before quantities and installation are agreed.\n\n[Discuss your wallcovering](https://www.mrwallcover.com/contact/?intent=source)\n\nBy [Dorin Burcus](https://www.mrwallcover.com/about/#dorin), founder · Last updated 18 October 2026\n",
